From 4e8db93d07542c89089f0dcce9147b1b760fc6ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:46:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Proxy /linkinbio.html on this domain to smartping-email's
 linktree page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a rewrite so pages.terratern.com/linkinbio.html transparently
serves smartping-email's /linktree.html (the public link-in-bio page,
whose content is now edited from a CMS in the Marketing CRM). The URL
bar stays as pages.terratern.com — this is a proxy rewrite to a full
external URL, not a redirect. Every other route on this domain and
project is untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LHzxqv9S6k47oG19wZF3Kx
---
 vercel.json | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/vercel.json b/vercel.json
index 1b5d45f..ac442a1 100644
--- a/vercel.json
+++ b/vercel.json
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 {
   "trailingSlash": false,
   "rewrites": [
-    { "source": "/", "destination": "/ausbildung-alumni.html" }
+    { "source": "/", "destination": "/ausbildung-alumni.html" },
+    { "source": "/linkinbio.html", "destination": "https://smartping-email.vercel.app/linktree.html" }
   ]
 }
-- 
2.43.0

